          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo omugabe Rehoboamu yaayegaruramu amaani, yaategyeka. Rehoboamu akaba aine emyaka makumi ana na gumwe, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi na mushanju omuri Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru MUKAMA yaatooraine omu nganda zoona ez'Abaisraeli kuba nimwo yaata eiziina rye. Nyina akaba naayetwa Naama omuamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora kubi, ahabw'okuba tarataire mutima aha kusherura MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
