            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu ebi Rehoboamu yaakozire okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho ekya Shemaaya nabi, n'ekya Ido omuhanuuzi? Kandi hakaba habaho obweme ahagati ya Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
